<p>When the going gets tough, you get tougher. You gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">0.3, 0.6, 1.0, 1.2, 1.5</acronym> Stamina regen per enemy in sight, and beginning at talent level 3 and above, you also gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1.0, 2.2, 3.2, 4.1, 5.0</acronym> life regen per enemy. The bonuses cap at 4 enemies.</p>